     "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87)\">Dear all,</span><div style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87)\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87)\">We are organising a new series of group level GGIR training where you buy a seat in the training. For detailed information see: <a rel=\"noreferrer nofollow noopener\" href=\"https://www.accelting.com/ggir-training/\" style=\"text-decoration-line:none;color:rgb(26,115,232)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.accelting.com/ggir-training/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489107223000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1rJywS9cbFCN-_RFnxEKdx\">https://www.accelting.com/ggir-training/</a></div><div style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87)\"><b><br></b></div><div style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87)\"><b>For those in the west (Europe/Africa/Americas):</b></div><div style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87)\"><ul><li style=\"list-style-type:&quot;- &quot;\"><b>1 and 2 July:<span> </span></b>R essentials for GGIR ideal for those with no R experience!</li><li style=\"list-style-type:&quot;- &quot;\"><b>15, 17 and 19 July : <span style=\"font-weight:400;display:inline!important;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Standard GGIR training</span></b><br></li></ul><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Fort those in the east (Asia/ Australia/Europe):</b></div><ul><li style=\"list-style-type:&quot;- &quot;\"><b style=\"font-weight:bold\">1 and 2 July:<span> </span></b>R essentials for GGIR ideal for those with no R experience!<br></li><li style=\"list-style-type:&quot;- &quot;\"><b><strike>15, 17 and 19 July: </strike><span style=\"font-weight:400;display:inline!important;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><strike>Standard GGIR training</strike> </span><span style=\"display:inline!important;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">(fully booked)</span></b><b></b></li><li style=\"list-style-type:&quot;- &quot;\"><b>22, 24 and 26 July:</b><span> </span>Standard GGIR training  </li></ul></div><div style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87)\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87)\">You can pay via the website with your Credit card or if applicable your PayPAL account. See FAQ about payment at the bottom of <span><a rel=\"noreferrer nofollow noopener\" href=\"https://www.accelting.com/ggir-training/\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.accelting.com/ggir-training/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489107223000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1rJywS9cbFCN-_RFnxEKdx\">https://www.accelting.com/ggir-training/</a>.</span></div><div style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87)\"><br></div><span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87)\">Best regards and looking forward seeing some of you at the training.</span><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87)\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87)\">Vincent</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(107,107,107)\">Dr. Vincent van Hees | Independent consultant | </span><a title=\"https://accelting.com/\" href=\"https://accelting.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://accelting.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489107223000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ge9RMlgmak99ybguZ51EU\">https://accelting.com/</a><br></div><div><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/RpackageGGIR/attach/a5bcbb038173b/image?part=0.1.1&amp;view=1\"><br></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    \r\n            <div>\r\n        \r\n            </div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
